(7175116, 1102346, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice rhythm in the fence.  The geese are a bonus.  Shore line, houses, and clouds in the distance add some interest too.  Nice find!</td>', 'Nice rhythm in the fence.  The geese are a bonus.  Shore line, houses, and clouds in the distance add some interest too.  Nice find!', '2014-02-12 02:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
