(7175289, 1102332, 16148, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but not your toning.  Strong contrast in b&amp;w would make this stronger IMO.  Still a 7 because of your composition and subject.</td>', 'I like the shot but not your toning.  Strong contrast in b&w would make this stronger IMO.  Still a 7 because of your composition and subject.', '2014-02-12 13:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175290, 1102266, 16148, '<td valign="top">Plays well for this challenge.  Nice find!</td>', 'Plays well for this challenge.  Nice find!', '2014-02-12 13:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175292, 1102002, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice minimal image.  The foot prints pointing out don''t look natural but maybe they are?  A 7 for this unique shot.</td>', 'Nice minimal image.  The foot prints pointing out don''t look natural but maybe they are?  A 7 for this unique shot.', '2014-02-12 13:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175294, 1102215, 16148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful water drop image that works well in color.  A nice addition to the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful water drop image that works well in color.  A nice addition to the challenge.', '2014-02-12 13:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175298, 1102298, 16148, '<td valign="top">I always enjoy topographic images with people.  This is no exception but the toning seems a little flat.  Still a very interesting shot with the carnival wheel in the distance.</td>', 'I always enjoy topographic images with people.  This is no exception but the toning seems a little flat.  Still a very interesting shot with the carnival wheel in the distance.', '2014-02-12 14:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175299, 1102316, 16148, '<td valign="top">A little hello kitty noir.  The clock appears to be excited to see you.  Clever shot!  Remember time is not your friend.</td>', 'A little hello kitty noir.  The clock appears to be excited to see you.  Clever shot!  Remember time is not your friend.', '2014-02-12 14:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175307, 1102298, 327, '<td valign="top">A perfect example for this challenge! Great shot.</td>', 'A perfect example for this challenge! Great shot.', '2014-02-12 14:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175313, 1102340, 174623, '<td valign="top">Lol :-)</td>', 'Lol :-)', '2014-02-12 14:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175317, 1102337, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very well seen. Perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'Very well seen. Perfect for the challenge.', '2014-02-12 15:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175320, 1102298, 108069, '<td valign="top">Has a real "classic" feel to it. It''s a classic scene, obviously, but I think your hands-off editing helps this as well. It''s not squashed by overcooking, and even the crooked horizon adds a casual "realness" to it.<br/> <br/>I''ve been atop the Arc many times and you can certainly feel and see the rhythm. Lights change, cars race, the roundabout fills and empties, arteries clog and release. It''s pretty amazing.</td>', 'Has a real "classic" feel to it. It''s a classic scene, obviously, but I think your hands-off editing helps this as well. It''s not squashed by overcooking, and even the crooked horizon adds a casual "realness" to it. I''ve been atop the Arc many times and you can certainly feel and see the rhythm. Lights change, cars race, the roundabout fills and empties, arteries clog and release. It''s pretty amazing.', '2014-02-12 15:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175328, 1102271, 108069, '<td valign="top">Clark/Lake! Really nicely framed and the shallow depth with incredible clarity makes this an excellent environmental portrait. Would also be fun to play with it in B&amp;W. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Clark/Lake! Really nicely framed and the shallow depth with incredible clarity makes this an excellent environmental portrait. Would also be fun to play with it in B&W. Nice lighting.', '2014-02-12 15:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
