(7176848, 1102139, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a nice binary rhythm to it.</td>', 'Has a nice binary rhythm to it.', '2014-02-14 23:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176902, 1102318, 9849, '<td valign="top">Nice work. My favourite from this challenge.</td>', 'Nice work. My favourite from this challenge.', '2014-02-15 04:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176918, 1102350, 91496, '<td valign="top">I liked the shadowed people in the foeground.  The centered pole is eally trying hard to be the subject and takes about from the overall impact.  Also with all the visual elemnets scattered about the image the rhythm connection is marginalized</td>', 'I liked the shadowed people in the foeground.  The centered pole is eally trying hard to be the subject and takes about from the overall impact.  Also with all the visual elemnets scattered about the image the rhythm connection is marginalized', '2014-02-15 07:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176919, 1102300, 91496, '<td valign="top">Simple yet vey effective.  I winder if the one piece of greenery being moved a touch towads the left would have given more impact.</td>', 'Simple yet vey effective.  I winder if the one piece of greenery being moved a touch towads the left would have given more impact.', '2014-02-15 07:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176920, 1101842, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, I think a tighter framing on the bridge pieces would have had more impact.</td>', 'I like the idea here, I think a tighter framing on the bridge pieces would have had more impact.', '2014-02-15 07:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176921, 1101841, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed and lit.  Desipite the repeating pattern and the nice colors this is somewhat lacking in visual appeal.  Perhaps the lack of any textures makes it too simple and plain.</td>', 'Nicely framed and lit.  Desipite the repeating pattern and the nice colors this is somewhat lacking in visual appeal.  Perhaps the lack of any textures makes it too simple and plain.', '2014-02-15 07:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176922, 1101834, 91496, '<td valign="top">Did not eally draw my interest in;  I think the detail outside of the mirror competes for my attention and neither is that visually strong.</td>', 'Did not eally draw my interest in;  I think the detail outside of the mirror competes for my attention and neither is that visually strong.', '2014-02-15 07:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176923, 1101963, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here.  I think that there are too many competing subjects,  with two sets of metal trim, the iceicles, and the house shapes all with the same visual weight.</td>', 'I like the idea here.  I think that there are too many competing subjects,  with two sets of metal trim, the iceicles, and the house shapes all with the same visual weight.', '2014-02-15 07:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176926, 1102266, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I like hte angle of view.   Not so nice title.  You can always call it "Untitled" if you ae stuck for a name.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I like hte angle of view.   Not so nice title.  You can always call it "Untitled" if you ae stuck for a name.', '2014-02-15 07:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176929, 1101907, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice composiiton.  I love all the angles.  While there is certainly patterns here, usually rrhythm is more organized and smmoth (and harmonious to steal a word from your title).  These patterns are going everywhere all at once.</td>', 'Nice composiiton.  I love all the angles.  While there is certainly patterns here, usually rrhythm is more organized and smmoth (and harmonious to steal a word from your title).  These patterns are going everywhere all at once.', '2014-02-15 07:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176930, 1102289, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The smoothness of the loops and bold lighting meets the rhythn description very well.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The smoothness of the loops and bold lighting meets the rhythn description very well.', '2014-02-15 07:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176931, 1102293, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the B&amp;W tones and all the shadows.  I find the man is actually an anti-rhythm as he breaks the patten and tries to become the subject.</td>', 'Love the B&W tones and all the shadows.  I find the man is actually an anti-rhythm as he breaks the patten and tries to become the subject.', '2014-02-15 07:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176932, 1102254, 91496, '<td valign="top">I turned my laptop sideways which may have destroyed some of the illusion.  That aaid this is very cool and you get an "A" for creativity (pun intended).  The rhythm connection is not as strong as it could be.</td>', 'I turned my laptop sideways which may have destroyed some of the illusion.  That aaid this is very cool and you get an "A" for creativity (pun intended).  The rhythm connection is not as strong as it could be.', '2014-02-15 07:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176933, 1102264, 91496, '<td valign="top">I wonder if a composition without the left side would be more powerful.  The right side is a powerful dynamic image but the left side creates a static area the removes much of the rhythm for me.</td>', 'I wonder if a composition without the left side would be more powerful.  The right side is a powerful dynamic image but the left side creates a static area the removes much of the rhythm for me.', '2014-02-15 07:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176935, 1101941, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  The crazy border really adds to it (assuming that is is leagal)  NOt sure I see as much of a rhythm connection here.</td>', 'Very nice image.  The crazy border really adds to it (assuming that is is leagal)  NOt sure I see as much of a rhythm connection here.', '2014-02-15 08:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176937, 1102298, 91496, '<td valign="top">Finding a hythm out of chaos when viewed from far away.  Works very well.  The circle at the end is a great item to have at the vanishing point.  Your horizon has a tiltl.</td>', 'Finding a hythm out of chaos when viewed from far away.  Works very well.  The circle at the end is a great item to have at the vanishing point.  Your horizon has a tiltl.', '2014-02-15 08:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176938, 1102314, 91496, '<td valign="top">Simple yet effective.  I love the reflections.  The bottom half is much more interesting than the top half.  I wonder if a differnet bottle order or spacing would help with that.</td>', 'Simple yet effective.  I love the reflections.  The bottom half is much more interesting than the top half.  I wonder if a differnet bottle order or spacing would help with that.', '2014-02-15 08:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176940, 1102187, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  The dice are way too static and stage.  If they were indeed "tumbling"  then the impact of the image would go way up.</td>', 'I like the composition.  The dice are way too static and stage.  If they were indeed "tumbling"  then the impact of the image would go way up.', '2014-02-15 08:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176941, 1102273, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very serene.  Good use of shadow and DOF.  Not sure if I like the ocks all the mauch, as they compete with teh blocks as much as the accent them.</td>', 'Very serene.  Good use of shadow and DOF.  Not sure if I like the ocks all the mauch, as they compete with teh blocks as much as the accent them.', '2014-02-15 08:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7176945, 1101637, 91496, '<td valign="top">This kind of cool.  Well seen and well shot.  Not sure I see a strong Rhythn connection here.</td>', 'This kind of cool.  Well seen and well shot.  Not sure I see a strong Rhythn connection here.', '2014-02-15 08:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177015, 1101607, 28427, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. Well done.</td>', 'Stunning image. Well done.', '2014-02-15 12:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177017, 1102315, 28427, '<td valign="top">Love the tones and the subtle mix of crispness and softness</td>', 'Love the tones and the subtle mix of crispness and softness', '2014-02-15 13:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177018, 1102215, 28427, '<td valign="top">Extra terrestrial forms in fresh earthy colors. Beautiful work.</td>', 'Extra terrestrial forms in fresh earthy colors. Beautiful work.', '2014-02-15 13:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177136, 1102318, 58634, '<td valign="top">My choice for the win. It instantly made me go, wow!</td>', 'My choice for the win. It instantly made me go, wow!', '2014-02-15 17:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7177257, 1102307, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice image with great lighting.  Border is odd -- go fo something simpler so as not to distract from the photo.  Rhythm connection is not very strong.</td>', 'Nice image with great lighting.  Border is odd -- go fo something simpler so as not to distract from the photo.  Rhythm connection is not very strong.', '2014-02-15 22:39:37.000000', NULL, 1);
