(7178571, 1102352, 173844, '<td valign="top">The strong rhythm created by the pilings and walkway of this pier leads to a small opening that resembles a door, lending a sense of enchantment.  I like how the crumbling of the structure is brought out.  The dark sepia tone of the picture isn''t appealing, unless its function is to enhance the feeling of decay.</td>', 'The strong rhythm created by the pilings and walkway of this pier leads to a small opening that resembles a door, lending a sense of enchantment.  I like how the crumbling of the structure is brought out.  The dark sepia tone of the picture isn''t appealing, unless its function is to enhance the feeling of decay.', '2014-02-18 21:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7178575, 1102324, 173844, '<td valign="top">This burst of pigeons creates a tumbling sort of rhythm against the background rhythm of the bridge.  It''s very lively, and draws the viewer deep within the image.  I like how the pigeon on the upper right seems to be actually emerging from the camera.</td>', 'This burst of pigeons creates a tumbling sort of rhythm against the background rhythm of the bridge.  It''s very lively, and draws the viewer deep within the image.  I like how the pigeon on the upper right seems to be actually emerging from the camera.', '2014-02-18 21:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7178578, 1102085, 173844, '<td valign="top">These fish on ice retain the metallic glimmering of a school of fish flashing about synchronously in the ocean.  They have the rhythm of a chorus line here, and our attention is especially held by the startlingly vivid eyes.  The rhythms of life are also being invoked.  It''s a strong image that holds one''s gaze.</td>', 'These fish on ice retain the metallic glimmering of a school of fish flashing about synchronously in the ocean.  They have the rhythm of a chorus line here, and our attention is especially held by the startlingly vivid eyes.  The rhythms of life are also being invoked.  It''s a strong image that holds one''s gaze.', '2014-02-18 21:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
