(7178588, 1102332, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image of a line of mannequins in distinctive poses, matching almost one to one within the large windows.  They have a casual, conversational flow that provides a gentle rhythm.  There''s also the sense that the photographer is saying, "look up now and then and you might be surprised by what you see."</td>', 'Wonderful image of a line of mannequins in distinctive poses, matching almost one to one within the large windows.  They have a casual, conversational flow that provides a gentle rhythm.  There''s also the sense that the photographer is saying, "look up now and then and you might be surprised by what you see."', '2014-02-18 21:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7178590, 1102272, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here''s an image with vertical rhythm.  The construction chute at right center looks like a rocket about to be launched, juxtaposed with laundry drying on a line!  The windows, especially the lit ones, also give a rhythmic lift.  There is certainly sufficient structure amid all the visual cacophony.  A pleasing image.</td>', 'Here''s an image with vertical rhythm.  The construction chute at right center looks like a rocket about to be launched, juxtaposed with laundry drying on a line!  The windows, especially the lit ones, also give a rhythmic lift.  There is certainly sufficient structure amid all the visual cacophony.  A pleasing image.', '2014-02-18 21:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7178592, 1102318, 173844, '<td valign="top">A reflected piano keyboard that kind of looks like eyelashes.  You can hardly get more rhythmic than that.  A clever, iconic image.</td>', 'A reflected piano keyboard that kind of looks like eyelashes.  You can hardly get more rhythmic than that.  A clever, iconic image.', '2014-02-18 21:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
