(7178611, 1101607, 173844, '<td valign="top">The sun''s rays splay rhythmically across the forest, bringing a cheery freshness to the day.  The profusion of the forest is calmed by the orderliness of the rays.  Very nice depiction of this beautiful phenomenon.</td>', 'The sun''s rays splay rhythmically across the forest, bringing a cheery freshness to the day.  The profusion of the forest is calmed by the orderliness of the rays.  Very nice depiction of this beautiful phenomenon.', '2014-02-18 22:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
