(7178615, 1102220, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely undulating rhythm between the rigid rhythm of upright columns, with  the satisfying payoff at the far end of a woman walking in front of a building.  I like the graininess of the image, which brings one to concentrate on the pure shapes.</td>', 'Lovely undulating rhythm between the rigid rhythm of upright columns, with  the satisfying payoff at the far end of a woman walking in front of a building.  I like the graininess of the image, which brings one to concentrate on the pure shapes.', '2014-02-18 22:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
