(7178919, 1101607, 124815, '<td valign="top">There is so much magic in the forest and you captured it so well. <br/>I recognized the shot as one of yours but I wondered where in Australia this is! Canada! This makes sense. You seem to travel without any discomfort from one continent to the other and I am jealous since for me the 6 and change hours NY-Paris is the most I can endure. Any tips for dealing with jet lag and duration of flight?<br/>Anyway, you have a knack for mist and fog and streaming light. Always with a tripod or hand held also?</td>', 'There is so much magic in the forest and you captured it so well. I recognized the shot as one of yours but I wondered where in Australia this is! Canada! This makes sense. You seem to travel without any discomfort from one continent to the other and I am jealous since for me the 6 and change hours NY-Paris is the most I can endure. Any tips for dealing with jet lag and duration of flight?Anyway, you have a knack for mist and fog and streaming light. Always with a tripod or hand held also?', '2014-02-19 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
